"id": "26709744002017972"}, "id": "28448773424781679", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "26709744002017972", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "966283832978790"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Screenshot with Deer Scope.png", "id": "1691502618728548", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823901_1691502622061881_313257318028832307_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k--oioeOP8YQ7kNvwE4VUZo&_nc_oc=AdogNwgtai4kJ3GpurzYQW1WtczLqd0EmP_yCDa9pnec8f_FqcZL9WcxXxq4CTY9Sn4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNl46xELzMphMtbTbEZy06VLUmwEfaNCYNYGbwDvjehfw&oe=6ACCF0E7"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot with House Jeep Airplane.png", "id": "1565173848518322", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_1565173851851655_293611742634863887_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zhaqxrZmH6wQ7kNvwHHioIo&_nc_oc=Adqvo4a98PpTs-h1NBobpP22D-bn4gJ1IexzNz8ey28e_scCaOMZkt5BDKvWDGRur6w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOd40nONRPImk2TtddZwDmlw1wnfjrzZf6AZLuTi0432A&oe=6ACD0A83"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot with helicopter.png", "id": "1024222440561665", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311585_1024222443894998_5505219204595535935_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IKO0DSjTTrkQ7kNvwHnLYq0&_nc_oc=AdpNQ1RKiVmyvWC0z_ZcMQdzCHQUe35HAv2FQKmoAU-7sr3nOE956xgVb46VB4f9QDQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMRIv9Bih9NQPcAaVPsThbjlg6S1qSxtWIdxA9VTEhxUw&oe=6ACD106A"}]}, "id": "1753206485937240", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hunting Simulator 2: Pr\u00e4zisionsjagd", "keywords": ["Jagdsimulator", "Jagd", "hunter", "virtual", "Jagdspiele"], "long_description": "# Erlebe die authentischste VR-Jagdsimulation mit realistischen Weitsch\u00fcssen. \nOb du deine Beute aus der Luft aufsp\u00fcrst oder dich lautlos durch dichtes Gel\u00e4nde pirschst \u2013 nur dein K\u00f6nnen entscheidet \u00fcber den Erfolg.\n{1565173848518322}\n**BEHERRSCHE DIE WILDNIS:**\n\n* **Realistische Ballistik:** Meistere authentische Schussmechaniken. Ber\u00fccksichtige Wind, Entfernung und Geschossabfall. Jeder Schuss verlangt h\u00f6chste Pr\u00e4zision und starke Nerven. {1691502618728548}\n* **Legend\u00e4res amerikanisches Wild:** Jage ikonische Tierarten wie Maultierhirsche, Wildschweine und Amerikanische Schwarzb\u00e4ren.\n* **Volle Bewegungsfreiheit:** Beherrsche jedes Terrain. Fliege Flugzeuge und Hubschrauber oder fahre mit deinem Gel\u00e4ndewagen zu den besten Aussichtspunkten. {1024222440561665}\n* **Professionelle Ausr\u00fcstung:** Nutze hochwertige Jagdgewehre und Pr\u00e4zisionsoptiken. Erlebe die Kraft authentischer Jagdausr\u00fcstung.\n* **Ungez\u00e4hmte Wildnis:** Erkunde riesige Landschaften. Verwalte Treibstoff und Ressourcen sorgf\u00e4ltig, w\u00e4hrend du raue und anspruchsvolle Gebiete durchquerst.\n\n**EARLY-ACCESS-ROADMAP:**\n\nWir erweitern das Spiel kontinuierlich. Demn\u00e4chst verf\u00fcgbar:\n\n* **Wasserwild:** Jage Enten und G\u00e4nse.\n* **Federwild:** Sp\u00fcre Truth\u00e4hne und Fasane auf.\n* **Kleinwild:** Meistere die Jagd auf Wachteln und Rebh\u00fchner.\n\nHast du das Zeug zum perfekten Schuss? R\u00fcste dich aus und sichere dir deine Troph\u00e4e.", "short_description": "Erlebe die ultimative Jagd in der amerikanischen Wildnis in VR! Pirsche Hirsche, B\u00e4ren und Wildschweine durch atemberaubende Landschaften. Meistere pr\u00e4zise Weitsch\u00fcsse, fliege Buschflugzeuge und Hubschrauber oder erkunde das Gel\u00e4nde mit gel\u00e4ndeg\u00e4ngigen Offroad-Fahrzeugen. Authentische Ausr\u00fcstung, realistische Ballistik und pures Survival erwarten dich. Bist du bereit f\u00fcr die Jagd deines Lebens? Lade jetzt herunter und sichere dir deine Troph\u00e4e!\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Screenshot with House Jeep Airplane.png", "id": "2292755628220042", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593909648_2292755631553375_4747310080233420799_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1j1KeQzoF1QQ7kNvwFsz0Np&_nc_oc=Adptng3zqvSnWTcHvMc7yUcklXh_MA0crjKMZVEPFJJBGrENHOWdYhLEviQBR_Pg9E8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPZ5yqCpDhP9DIMD3XQ9-G46SPyDJttb38tkHQaua9Rwg&oe=6ACCF337"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot with Deer Scope.png", "id": "2131381550755003", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312332_2131381554088336_5787859982724967283_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J58r1N1GJVYQ7kNvwFE8Ccc&_nc_oc=Adpqw5vf0Kpevi3eVwqsTLNNc0yMBshUM9A29FoHQU4QArQ0KNrBqJ0bPNyWtwHPq9E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOPjr0EcxGKr64u8raO_YNsyT-kjV4IFBJhEgOB2y4IpA&oe=6ACD14DB"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot with helicopter.png", "id": "1041321218452084", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604370996_1041321221785417_8626986679439647874_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FPBZ_GPWj_UQ7kNvwEU9zd8&_nc_oc=Adr6agxO5BAREeRgdufjjhur5TyVu4eaYdt8XAzA8qwNc9-gIoACn31qZGYtKzDtziU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO7oDFCp4GwNlpSQMaK0IlmD6mrMbsbOssX-kjCDtowvw&oe=6ACCE42D"}]}, "id": "1463713765605387", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hunting Simulator 2: Chasse Pro", "keywords": ["hunter", "virtual", "tir", "cerf", "Traque"], "long_description": "# Plongez au c\u0153ur des grands espaces am\u00e9ricains et mettez votre instinct \u00e0 l'\u00e9preuve. \nD\u00e9couvrez l'exp\u00e9rience de chasse \u00e0 longue distance en VR la plus authentique. Que vous rep\u00e9riez votre gibier depuis les airs ou le traquiez \u00e0 travers la nature sauvage, seule votre ma\u00eetrise fera la diff\u00e9rence.\n{2292755628220042}\n**DOMINEZ LA NATURE SAUVAGE**:\n\n- **Balistique R\u00e9aliste** : Ma\u00eetrisez des m\u00e9caniques fid\u00e8les \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9. Tenez compte du vent, de la distance et de la chute des balles. Chaque tir exige pr\u00e9cision et sang-froid. {2131381550755003}\n- **Gibier Am\u00e9ricain Mythique** : Chassez des esp\u00e8ces embl\u00e9matiques comme le cerf mulet, le sanglier et l'ours noir d'Am\u00e9rique.\n- **Mobilit\u00e9 Totale** : Parcourez tous les terrains. Pilotez des avions et des h\u00e9licopt\u00e8res ou conduisez votre v\u00e9hicule tout-terrain pour trouver le meilleur poste de tir. {1041321218452084}\n- **\u00c9quipement Professionnel** : Utilisez des carabines haut de gamme et des optiques de pr\u00e9cision. Ressentez toute la puissance d'un \u00e9quipement authentique.\n- **Nature Sauvage Immense** : Explorez de vastes biomes. G\u00e9rez vos ressources et votre carburant avec soin pour survivre dans un environnement impitoyable.\n\n# FEUILLE DE ROUTE \u2013 ACC\u00c8S ANTICIP\u00c9 :\n\nNous continuons d'enrichir le jeu. Prochainement :\n\n- **Gibier d'Eau** : Chassez les canards et les oies.\n- **Oiseaux de Plain**e : Traquez les dindons sauvages et les faisans.\n- **Petit Gibier** : Perfectionnez votre chasse aux cailles et aux perdrix.\n\nAvez-vous ce qu'il faut pour r\u00e9aliser le tir parfait ? Pr\u00e9parez votre \u00e9quipement et remportez\n", "short_description": "Vivez la chasse ultime en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans les grands espaces am\u00e9ricains ! Traquez des cerfs, des ours et des sangliers \u00e0 travers des paysages spectaculaires. Ma\u00eetrisez le tir de pr\u00e9cision \u00e0 longue distance, pilotez des hydravions et des h\u00e9licopt\u00e8res ou explorez en v\u00e9hicules tout-terrain. \u00c9quipement authentique, balistique r\u00e9aliste et aventure immersive vous attendent. T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez le jeu et remportez votre troph\u00e9e !"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Screenshot with helicopter.png", "id": "2192130464984320", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_2192130468317653_3908069124844468529_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Savhc9wGIsQ7kNvwH9ZVKW&_nc_oc=AdqsAz8GbntAK5TmJPMHT3xicSHmyuCwW816qQB2NSxmptAOQR8gkbk--4QNNyZWyPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPvZ4P8SOGykMsXGqKVuPstYRSHOzYTo9nJzuTXKuVE0g&oe=6ACD0444"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot with Deer Scope.png", "id": "1560692029073510", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_1560692032406843_6584434721810279786_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DLACm8u2Js8Q7kNvwHk216k&_nc_oc=Ado_kCWYf8O8kYsRznEI6G6KLI5RFEY5M7SqRnRFPUyziK2fzRp0rYeRZ6SOX6_lRic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNoewXsHIH2SBMNrM5STPG9kj30WCTMrxvkK3aRUDg0Rw&oe=6ACCFF27"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot with House Jeep Airplane.png", "id": "1114554667682650", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825546_1114554677682649_7981731337265283035_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PX8VAxrx2e4Q7kNvwFCF6fD&_nc_oc=Ado0HP0KTxaQ-r0UVZZba-jTYmYbgXd8n0n_71dtMFN5e5Ok-DF3QLoSQHykZaWd8Tw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQND99kvNY7m0-LHFcGSXXNx89OiWkkoTv1dMrgyVVqJvw&oe=6ACCE461"}]}, "id": "1409537597471391", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hunting Simulator 2: Francotirador", "keywords": ["Cacer\u00eda", "Armas", "caseria", "Disparos", "caza"], "long_description": "# La Experiencia de Caza Americana Definitiva\n\nAd\u00e9ntrate en la inmensa naturaleza salvaje de Estados Unidos y pon a prueba tus instintos.  \nVive una aut\u00e9ntica aventura de caza a larga distancia creada para la realidad virtual. Ya sea explorando el terreno desde el aire o siguiendo el rastro de tu presa entre la naturaleza, tu habilidad ser\u00e1 tu mayor ventaja. \n{1114554667682650}\n**DOMINA LA NATURALEZA:** \n \n- **Bal\u00edstica de Precisi\u00f3n:** Domina mec\u00e1nicas de tiro realistas. Ten en cuenta el viento, la elevaci\u00f3n y la ca\u00edda de la bala. Cada disparo exige precisi\u00f3n y pulso firme. {1560692029073510}\n- **Fauna Emblem\u00e1tica de Estados Unidos:** Caza especies legendarias, como el venado bura, el jabal\u00ed y el oso negro americano. \n- **Movilidad Total:** Enfr\u00e9ntate al terreno a tu manera. Pilota aviones y helic\u00f3pteros o conduce tu 4x4 por caminos accidentados para encontrar el punto de observaci\u00f3n perfecto. {2192130464984320}\n- **Equipo Profesional:** Equ\u00edpate con rifles de alto nivel y \u00f3pticas avanzadas. Experimenta la potencia y precisi\u00f3n de un aut\u00e9ntico equipo de caza. \n- **Naturaleza Salvaje:** Explora enormes biomas y administra tus recursos y combustible con inteligencia mientras recorres un entorno implacable. \n \n\u00bfEst\u00e1s listo para realizar el disparo perfecto? Equ\u00edpate, ad\u00e9ntrate en la naturaleza y consigue tu trofeo.\n", "short_description": "\u00a1La mejor cacer\u00eda de Norteam\u00e9rica en VR! \ud83c\udf32\ud83e\udd8c\nRastrea venados, osos y jabal\u00edes en paisajes incre\u00edbles.\n\ud83c\udfaf Domina el rifle de francotirador con bal\u00edstica realista.\n\ud83d\ude81 \u00a1Pilota helic\u00f3pteros, avionetas o maneja tu 4x4 para buscar a tu presa!\n\ud83c\udf92 Sobrevive con equipo aut\u00e9ntico en la naturaleza salvaje.\n\u00bfTienes lo necesario para el tiro perfecto? \u00a1Desc\u00e1rgalo hoy y consigue tu trofeo! \ud83c\udfc6"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Screenshot with helicopter.png", "id": "3074033742794244", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_3074033746127577_5976846713048237_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HyT1RnWIJK0Q7kNvwE6kE6C&_nc_oc=AdqpT6K58QqbMHS-Ao3Y51O3YsZy38Ke_ydzmr7BdHn6iNTy-65cSc8NzR-EiAVBPj4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPQLfOYBdtPsAwpT4ewK5NTI-S_ks8bt4VHFKuiDZEGwQ&oe=6ACD05BA"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot with House Jeep Airplane.png", "id": "1546921823826208", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1546921827159541_8586418109996189063_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aGklThIQPhoQ7kNvwF9FKKg&_nc_oc=AdoQY6jY3KI5R9ZlizKnDVTCvGux5zh27k_f291r3CJKZNEbmx3dgnax6LXdsQWygJg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMtHu0FSxyVTAWrkIoTl9rmAkSbY89lFg8AmDZWvkTytA&oe=6ACD10BC"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot with Deer Scope.png", "id": "986860827460610", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593990472_986860830793943_5366338799307492254_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IEQy50qvkL8Q7kNvwFriIUc&_nc_oc=AdqYxYM9N_UEnxkekINHdJVsYNinsj-HM_meKY8vQR4tAlrcka5jav2GOG47CCvEtN8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOSUBADBkqW9cqfmTydf-BHsG8DSPkqONmfiSjKhyJNNA&oe=6ACD0112"}, {"file_name": "Hunting Shooter Icon 512x512.png", "id": "1977803472840419", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_1977803479507085_649961535539724329_n.png?_nc_cat